    {
      "kind": "native-adaptation",
      "reason": "2026-11-01: @ai-sdk/openai 4.0.102 -> 4.0.106; integrity-verified published sources/declarations and matching-release tests 612be2311464804d1e4897afacbf8f3fc2f6d9e3 -> 9b603d36186b75e58d5479445a96c76f6e2d2700 reviewed independently. New native behavior is covered by Weekly20261101 suites. Internal TypeScript catalog/documentation/type-inference declarations are represented by native request policies, not an exact JS export contract. Prior imported provenance and known gaps remain unchanged. Portable reasoning maps against model-supported effort sets while provider reasoningEffort remains unchanged; GPT-5.6 Chat function tools disable portable reasoning and GPT-6.1 Terra supports non-reasoning sampling. GPT-5 keeps cache retention and Responses logprobs. Untyped propertyNames constraints are removed with one warning; completion errors contain misplaced system content. Searching web-search terminals are errors through the shared generation/stream/batch parser. Decisions sends bounded object/object-array evidence as input_json and promptCacheKey, with UTF-8/depth/value limits and text fallback. REST transcription uses catalog-equivalent defaults only for Whisper/diarization, timestamps only with verbose_json and duration-billed usage fallback. Native streaming transcription adds the published realtime-whisper/Live/turn-based models and dated aliases, languages/delay policy, raw deltas/final events and cancellation. Native async API key suppliers resolve per authenticated HTTP request and server WebSocket connection; explicit provider/request auth headers retain precedence. Files managed operations and streaming multipart resolve before send; Skills and Batch use the shared credential-aware transport."
    }
  ],
  "reviewNote": "Imported M0 file ownership and upstream test inventory. These are candidate relationships, not claims that every listed upstream test is ported; refine into behavior mappings during extraction. 2026-11-01: @ai-sdk/openai 4.0.102 -> 4.0.106; integrity-verified published sources/declarations and matching-release tests 612be2311464804d1e4897afacbf8f3fc2f6d9e3 -> 9b603d36186b75e58d5479445a96c76f6e2d2700 reviewed independently. New native behavior is covered by Weekly20261101 suites. Internal TypeScript catalog/documentation/type-inference declarations are represented by native request policies, not an exact JS export contract. Prior imported provenance and known gaps remain unchanged. 2026-11-08 published delta review and focused translations: Docs/WeeklyUpstreamAudit20261108.json; release-matched provenance and native adaptations retained separately from full-package parity. 2026-11-08 compatibility supplement: preserved exact public function-reference selectors from canonical pre-run b34e233f033adde06bff302f5d3d11c12f73733e: OpenAITools.mcp(serverLabel:allowedTools:authorization:connectorID:headers:requireApproval:serverDescription:serverURL:). Forwarding overloads retain original defaults and explicit new-option defaults; Weekly20261108ProviderSelectorCompatibilityTests also verifies extended references, defaulted calls and runtime forwarding. No upstream baseline or behavioral disposition is changed by this supplement.",
